## Test Safety
- NEVER skip a failing test — fix the root cause.
- Run tests before marking any task complete to ensure zero regressions.

## Commit Safety
- NEVER commit secrets, API keys, credentials, or `.env` files.
- Refer to `.gitignore` to see which paths should be kept clean of agent/test logs.
